---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Contact PHP Teacher" 
  description="Contact PHP Teacher - questions, corrections, content suggestions and partnership requests for the free PHP learning resource."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[85rem] px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-100 mb-6">Contact</h1>

      <div class="prose prose-blog sm:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p>
          PHP Teacher is maintained by the Laravel Company ecosystem. Whether you found an error in an
          article, want to suggest a topic, or have a question about the site, we would like to hear from you.
        </p>

        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p>
          The fastest way to reach the team behind PHP Teacher is by email:
          <a href="mailto:info@laravelcompany.com">info@laravelcompany.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What to contact us about</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Corrections</strong> - if an answer or article is wrong or outdated, tell us and we will fix it.</li>
          <li><strong>Content suggestions</strong> - PHP or Laravel topics you would like us to cover.</li>
          <li><strong>Partnerships</strong> - see our <a href="/partners/">partners page</a> first, then write to us.</li>
          <li><strong>Privacy questions</strong> - anything about your data is covered by our <a href="/privacy-policy">privacy policy</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Open source</h2>
        <p>
          Parts of the ecosystem are developed in the open on
          <a href="https://github.com/laravelcompany">GitHub</a>, where you can also report issues.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
